      "chapter": "77900",
      "source_id": "7059-77900-0040",
      "speaker": "7059",
      "transcript": "OH THEN SAID ANNIE PERHAPS HE ACCOUNTS FOR HER PLAYING JULIET",
      "transcript_file_sha256": "87e0c1a7ce2fafa5500930a42bed8653a3c0e610019494002e52462201e570fe",
      "transcript_member": "LibriSpeech/train-clean-100/7059/77900/7059-77900.trans.txt"
    },
    {
      "chapter": "77900",
      "source_id": "7059-77900-0041",
      "speaker": "7059",
      "transcript": "OH IT'S AT THE REHEARSALS YOU KNOW THAT THE FUN IS",
      "transcript_file_sha256": "87e0c1a7ce2fafa5500930a42bed8653a3c0e610019494002e52462201e570fe",
      "transcript_member": "LibriSpeech/train-clean-100/7059/77900/7059-77900.trans.txt"
    },
    {
      "chapter": "86815",
      "source_id": "7302-86815-0022",
      "speaker": "7302",
      "transcript": "AND TURNED HIS EYES WITH INDIFFERENCE TO THE OTHER SIDE",
      "transcript_file_sha256": "af0ded504bf0e8ae0b6ba708a28f68c7beb0ea5b7cdee21d33c4e26811ae7ca5",
      "transcript_member": "LibriSpeech/train-clean-100/7302/86815/7302-86815.trans.txt"
    },
    {
      "chapter": "86815",
      "source_id": "7302-86815-0081",
      "speaker": "7302",
      "transcript": "THINK OF IT MADAME HE SAID IF ON MY RETURN",
      "transcript_file_sha256": "af0ded504bf0e8ae0b6ba708a28f68c7beb0ea5b7cdee21d33c4e26811ae7ca5",
      "transcript_member": "LibriSpeech/train-clean-100/7302/86815/7302-86815.trans.txt"
    },
    {
      "chapter": "359",
      "source_id": "730-359-0049",
      "speaker": "730",
      "transcript": "HAPPY HAPPY EARTH FIT HABITATION FOR GODS WHICH SO SHORT A TIME BEFORE",
      "transcript_file_sha256": "4459b6ad76b80c68c9691391162ffb984f4125f6849a508d2f0fa6203cf042f8",
      "transcript_member": "LibriSpeech/train-clean-100/730/359/730-359.trans.txt"
    },
    {
      "chapter": "359",
      "source_id": "730-359-0008",
      "speaker": "730",
      "transcript": "A CONSIDERABLE PERIOD ELAPSED",
      "transcript_file_sha256": "4459b6ad76b80c68c9691391162ffb984f4125f6849a508d2f0fa6203cf042f8",
      "transcript_member": "LibriSpeech/train-clean-100/730/359/730-359.trans.txt"
    },
    {
      "chapter": "61334",
      "source_id": "6531-61334-0066",
      "speaker": "6531",
      "transcript": "AND THEREFORE UNABLE EITHER TO ASSERT ITS AUTHORITY IN JUDAH",
      "transcript_file_sha256": "33ff416e4907b5c39e49e5993df715b2c426e81a4902f4619bb48825ecab69ae",
      "transcript_member": "LibriSpeech/train-clean-100/6531/61334/6531-61334.trans.txt"
    },
    {
      "chapter": "61334",
      "source_id": "6531-61334-0132",
      "speaker": "6531",
      "transcript": "FOR OVER HALF A CENTURY AFTER THIS DISASTER BABYLONIA WAS A PROVINCE OF ASSYRIA",
      "transcript_file_sha256": "33ff416e4907b5c39e49e5993df715b2c426e81a4902f4619bb48825ecab69ae",
      "transcript_member": "LibriSpeech/train-clean-100/6531/61334/6531-61334.trans.txt"
    },
    {
      "chapter": "135883",
      "source_id": "1235-135883-0025",
      "speaker": "1235",
      "transcript": "TO BID MY WIFE AND CHILDREN ADIEU AND",
      "transcript_file_sha256": "f17262fed510ce6d5fde071a6415c502d35b3e8789e783a2abf49fcd7e986e34",
      "transcript_member": "LibriSpeech/train-clean-100/1235/135883/1235-135883.trans.txt"
    },
    {
      "chapter": "135887",
      "source_id": "1235-135887-0018",
      "speaker": "1235",
      "transcript": "BUT CAUSED HIM TO BE CLAD IN A RICH ROBE",
      "transcript_file_sha256": "694d56774964a4d5d5b9a2914f0dde39b924fddd3141770a3e9ed3a74252a0c1",
      "transcript_member": "LibriSpeech/train-clean-100/1235/135887/1235-135887.trans.txt"
    },
    {
      "chapter": "26870",
      "source_id": "4859-26870-0020",
      "speaker": "4859",
      "transcript": "SHE IS A STERILE FLOWER YOU KNOW LIKE SOME STRAWBERRY BLOSSOMS",
      "transcript_file_sha256": "0d270cf499428021bc3846e066d4ce2dd5690a6f1475f8c9fbbcbbf177a96fcd",
      "transcript_member": "LibriSpeech/train-clean-100/4859/26870/4859-26870.trans.txt"
    },
    {
      "chapter": "29340",
      "source_id": "4859-29340-0039",
      "speaker": "4859",
      "transcript": "ARE SIGNIFICANT FROM THE FACT THAT AFTER SERIOUSLY AND MINUTELY EXAMINING",
      "transcript_file_sha256": "dd7cef384043466d12e434d5e68ab468f4c8bf0c98b0a917560ede83a7f193da",
      "transcript_member": "LibriSpeech/train-clean-100/4859/29340/4859-29340.trans.txt"
    },
    {
      "chapter": "121124",
      "source_id": "125-121124-0021",
      "speaker": "125",
      "transcript": "HE WOULD HAVE INTERESTED HIMSELF SOMEWHAT MORE ABOUT IT STILL SAID CHATEAU RENAUD",
